We write $\begin{aligned}
\langle m|n\rangle &= \delta_{mn}, \\
|\psi\rangle &= \sum_n a_n |n\rangle.\end{aligned}$ Here $\delta_{mn}$ is the Kronecker delta: it is $1$ when $m=n$ and $0$ otherwise.

